Or play the way I do - all starting equipment is off limits.  :)
With a tourist, this is pretty tough.  I get a lot more enjoyment
out of the game this way though - damn those orcs are HARD without
armor.  

Other things to try - kill (yes, kill) your pet when you start.  
Bad luck right off the bat.  

Wishes are illegal.  Any time you get one, wish for a rock.

Don't ID anything.  In fact, don't enchant anything either.  :)

Of course, once you have the right equipment, the game is just
the same old run for the amulet.  Try limiting your equipment
in strange ways - no potions allowed, etc.  No rings is VERY difficult.

That should be enough to give even the most masterful hackers
a challenge.  Happy fleeing.  

